      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I bet your friend could add a symbol or something akin to one somewhere on the avatar itself, much like those floating bands people wear, or even change their username to incorporate their identity. Just an idea!\nDeliberate misgendering being a reportable offense might be a bit much though. If people unable to see a person for whatever reason (They are in another room, the avatar is hidden, etc.), and they sound like a male/female, people are simply going to use the most likely pronouns to try and address them. At that point, even if no offense was meant, if people are offended anyway that seems a bit one-sided and unfair.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
